                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice little puzzle platformer! \n\nIn Cubrick you control two characters simultaneously, and have to move them so they arrive at two exits at the same time. The two cubemen aren't allowed to touch each other, or the level resets. Same goes for falling in lava or touching enemies. \n\nThe game has great jazzy music, and the visual style is simple but very nice nonetheless! \n\nThere isn't much more to say about this game. I'm surprised that it had so few players in the five years this game is on Steam. \n\n70/100\n\n[table]\n[tr]\n[td]\n[i]More reviews at [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/39546715/]Omnivore Gamer[/url], games that are easy to control (for handicapped gamers). [/i][/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]",
